Package: zzcondpower
Title: Exact Conditional Power for Two-Arm Trials with Binary Outcomes
Version: 0.2.0
Authors@R:
    person(given = "Ronald G.", family = "Thomas", email = "rgthomas@ucsd.edu", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Exact stochastic curtailment calculations for interim
    monitoring of two-arm randomized clinical trials whose final
    analysis is the one-sided Fisher exact test. Computes the exact
    rejection region and its conditional power by enumeration under
    simultaneous entry, extends the calculation to staggered entry
    and censored time-to-event follow-up through an exact
    Poisson-binomial formulation with subject-specific event
    probabilities, and provides the normal-approximation conditional
    power in the Halperin tradition for comparison, together with
    exact sample-size search and design-grid comparison utilities.
